      "uid": "zhcn:3b58811e1f6174d323ed22da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a567d2c537055b11126b7aa2bfc64ecabc968c30c189efc9e002be6dde7881",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee1653919a88d59a1f0442f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c922c5de8a35921e2086ab355870227069194ca65614c757deb698452d7f0151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b57f5fdeb7858b4f960b28c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "278683594757457acff77da15cdaaf30c12da415579fe10a50d522b313cf92d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:622bb2672ef545e93d9e0bb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感情很好呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ebd11937f1716a3264a83ed6eab4b15ddf7bba6842d2a8034183653066bd0e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:289e7e92d4542c1d6bcfb0b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2bfeb016b31251d02d124e40bbc72c49d33cc628f270bda341fc51699d29a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ff644ae2b224d187984e66d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9038ab316c393129b96e38ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8128736cd152dda414d5365ab84d59a129ea70d5e92ea64f1f3e8cc0b57eaad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c13c841a838dbb5a2096831",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec9510babac054e7c407ef5aa0246c43f620214eff20c52274a9a071ec721a62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6051487e298d7ed2015efd5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce5901cb63dbf19ecfa34adb0d91bb30a07686f98def0ab67ffe11858885f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:030639424c0fc022674ecce2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天准备了这些奖励等着你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbb5dd1852e98515d4505d13861f98df80484e668c57742ffdf6697b12c4d6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ea7bbc6176f74678f39589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……\r\n不、不好意思……我居然在叹气……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a864e4a6e94bca71253a2e2f6d92f08cc67e3873c615662e1abfe2a6328fe316",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42a08cb74eb9ed9e00bd2b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……\r\n我的身体……到底是怎么了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9d836be406d939baec941e7392476942927fe09baea3c5072b41b8e6912bc5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03dd044afd6cf9de8024071",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的干劲就像春天的花坛一样，\r\n已经盛开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "729b74755eb102d97173b33658507bd4d975e96f9cfff9ff6148c2edb0e59f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50d806b0cc60e47321726336",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，今天也要加油！\r\n目标是不断成长──喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0c270a9e6d3ff2aabad8725d2462721e8fa5d99284ef4a965032f1245bcbe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c3c11dc00b6907cc1eaad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天状况不错呢♪\r\n你看，我的耳朵比平常挺直呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "260f45a4648724f7ec76f13d8ba437048f968f77c62ff82c0ce4f31e6cc18f1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f571a3cce6667c43b694b847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，请问有新的训练项目吗？\r\n我想努力做更多的尝试……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f71b62b2b13066e78267cc8fea7001c5031ff32911648ee22165f54327f1078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b223380974c10dd52001b347",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备好了！\r\n训练员，\r\n今天也请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a8787c0bb91aa818f64e8fdb32e486089fd92f8a9a9770dc2157f455a0249e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeecacd1891412a08840fc2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "除了毛巾和水壶以外……我还替\r\n训练员带了许多东西，\r\n如果有需要就跟我说吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e05608439bc3726adca78e928e1316d2e751583ed9b93fe82289cd8bc8012752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf4c4d3a4e15c2fdc2dce10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看起来没什么精神……？\r\n不，没这回事！\r\n我跟平常一样喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d87ff727167920e12d4321b6f6ab4fda8e5cdf4d6cbaef8734c4be6d641fab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8a15621d81d544bdfe1f26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必须振作一点……\r\n无论如何，\r\n都不能缺席训练……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9bb61997b5e36191f17983c338a8cf1476ed8fc361ce97c0c1ef993bc9a38eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8909353d51fcb001d4b8355f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……对不起，我居然东张西望的。\r\n必须集中精神才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc6c7fdf1b97e88c27d793b647f0740ad1e550bc03a3f25b0ba5ea0c1446e284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08da6a946d660b36452e7afb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果不往上看……原本能绽放的\r\n花苞也会变得无法绽放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f202aae2c5b18916e1e2d9b3909bbbeddd0e3e81d46c0d9f7fb637529ede695",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a1c6b432c512cd1ba345720",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要继续参赛啊……\r\n呃……如果中间能休息一下，\r\n我应该会表现得更好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d79e544ab5b018d90dbbdc1980c804982cc0a70d3ec9d64fe567a463df62f82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0641479b627db5e859ca933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白必须多赢几场比赛……\r\n不过，偶尔也需要休息……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b726f3d0fdaf7baa0f9cb3dee55c657b10d85e59b9bb4d42b832bb0532454e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f5580de71647feee7408ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使只是一朵小花，\r\n应该也能替某人带来勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72f4c124eedf03d2cc64e0bfde33ca2d89e311d47eed5e0dc720a5b8235487e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f525a54f0bb508be3c61f3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了在大家心中\r\n绽放出硕大的花朵……\r\n西野花，要出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bc6f574791296b4d703eedaac999170565b6469e3d7fb2d119722459646ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6fcd4de3543d1271f632008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要去使出我现在的全力，\r\n跑出不输大家的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b67e9926392c72d9a9ec093c66a9f0eed667744275960bfc9d1e29adf1dfca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06444e7d18f429ba1a94fce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果能替没什么精神，\r\n或是无法踏出最后一步的某人\r\n带来勇气……那就太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c4fdca58f32113a3d0759c0181023a12fa8abc9f888a6101d41e8b4a45d725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:398384a624941c6468868b2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天可是跟平常不一样喔♪\r\n我会让你看见比平常\r\n还要出色的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1737297abc6e2dba39d7509627b5caa12aa901883c41be591dbbc9a0b8ea9a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3679d340efe9af9e930e9bf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体状况没问题，也没忘记带东西。\r\n接下来只要全力奔跑就好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9b71ea2c88b1fa57ea0f316dc0fe9239e9778a6dccab27fff91d9cdddb0c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0743ed3dac84ac32f132a5d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了所有支持我的人……\r\n我会尽全力用心奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88dd86e62f79a36535019573703948997b0a6e688791f442338de6bfb6ea8758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58890531bb9f936353d48819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～我会按照平常的步调努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6ac7e888ef34f2c26e690955f846cba4002e802264c5179fd3e39f0ba331f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4758a538ed8b84a45072e417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会一点一点地向前迈进，\r\n直到成为一个\r\n出色的姐姐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8413559e69f926f8cf70b02a28704d5d85a1108d5b15c935f0d58ee09be9a0e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5505fc0cf01384d93b3e4d1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有点不安……\r\n但这种时候，\r\n更需要好好振作起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a53b03effc979fbb50cc70349c63bc33d803bf281ae104495b979bef30a57d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "20032"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
